plm-fulcrum — Authors and Copyright Holders
============================================

Original project (Fulcrum)
---------------------------
Calin A. Culianu <calin.culianu@gmail.com>
https://github.com/cculianu/Fulcrum

Fulcrum is the upstream SPV server for Bitcoin Cash, Bitcoin (BTC) and
Litecoin that this project is forked from. All core Electrum-protocol
server logic, the RocksDB storage engine, and BCH/BTC/LTC support are
his work. Copyright (C) 2019-2026.

Palladium (PLM) fork (plm-fulcrum)
------------------------------------
Davide Grilli <davide.grilli@outlook.com>
https://github.com/davide3011/plm-fulcrum

Added Palladium (PLM) coin support: coin detection, address codec,
SegWit serialization wiring, PLM-specific unit tests, and the Docker
deployment setup (palladiumd + fulcrum-plm). Copyright (C) 2025-2026.

